graph LR
    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. ACTORS DEFINITION (Rectangles)
    %% ==========================================
    Guest["ผู้ใช้งานทั่วไป (Guest)"]
    Customer["ลูกค้า (Customer)"]
    Staff["พนักงาน (Staff)"]
    Manager["ผู้จัดการ (Manager / Admin)"]

    %% Actor Relationships
    Customer --> Guest
    Manager --> Staff

    %% ==========================================
